account-bitwarden-integration = Bitwarden integration
account-bitwarden-heading = Connect ProxiedMail to Bitwarden
account-bitwarden-intro = In Bitwarden, add a forwarded email alias using these values. ProxiedMail mimics the Addy.io integration, so choose the Addy.io provider and use the details below.
account-bitwarden-step-one = Open Bitwarden and create or edit a login item.
account-bitwarden-step-two = Choose Forwarded email alias as the username or email-alias option.
account-bitwarden-step-three = Select Addy.io as the service.
account-bitwarden-step-four = Choose an available ProxiedMail email domain and use the API key shown below.
account-bitwarden-step-five = Set the self-host server URL to https://proxiedmail.com, then save the Bitwarden item.
